  "title": "How are UNION and UNION ALL different in SQL?",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Course: SQL Interview Questions"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "How are UNION and UNION ALL different in SQL?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "While both UNION and UNION ALL are used to combine the results of multiple SELECT statements into a single result set, there is one key difference between the two."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "UNION removes duplicate rows from the combined result set. On the other hand, UNION ALL does not remove duplicate rows from the combined result set."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Consider the following two tables:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Table - Midlands"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        [
          "team_id",
          "name"
        ],
        [
          "3",
          "Spurs"
        ],
        [
          "4",
          "United"
        ],
        [
          "5",
          "Liverpool"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Table - London"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        [
          "team_id",
          "name"
        ],
        [
          "1",
          "Chelsea"
        ],
        [
          "2",
          "Arsenal"
        ],
        [
          "3",
          "Spurs"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "UNION"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "sql",
      "content": "1SELECT team_id, name\n2FROM London\n3UNION\n4SELECT team_id, name\n5FROM Midlands;"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "UNION ALL"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "sql",
      "content": "1SELECT team_id, name\n2FROM London\n3UNION ALL \n4SELECT team_id, name\n5FROM Midlands;"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": "How does it work?"
    },
